<title>SPAIN: Popular to charge 16 bln ptas to reserves in 1997.</title>
<headline>Popular to charge 16 bln ptas to reserves in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Popular said on Wednesday it would provision for an 18.5 billion peseta early retirement plan, of which 16 billion pesetas would be charged to reserves in 1997.  </p>
<p>In a statement, Popular said the retirement plan had been approved by the Bank of Spain and was part of a strategy aimed at increasing the group's operating efficiency.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
